type: software
title: 'QueryRev AI Readiness'
abstract: >-
  Command line and library that read a site's public files and report how they treat AI
  crawlers: robots.txt access for a list of AI crawlers, llms.txt validation and generation,
  and structured-data findings, each with its evidence. No model calls, no telemetry.
